# Character combat architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/character-combat.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/character-combat.md).

**Permanent decision:** on-foot fight is one **character combat** loop (TPS
camera + firearm feel) in walk modes only — planet / station / deck. Firearms:
catalog weapons + ammo, bolt/single/burst/auto, ballistic drop, ADS (sprint
suppresses). Melee and throwables are in-scope. Cell owns entity hits / damage;
client predicts FX / HUD. **≠** [Ship combat](../../docs/docs/architecture/ship-combat.md).
Walk / facing: [Character locomotion](../../docs/docs/architecture/character-locomotion.md).
Peers: [Multiplayer](../../docs/docs/architecture/multiplayer.md). Vitals:
[Player](../../docs/docs/architecture/player.md).

When changing firearms, ADS, ballistics, ammo reload, melee, throwables,
crosshair/recoil, or on-foot hit authority, read the full doc first. Also listed
in `AGENTS.md`.
